    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in significant harm to the living conditions of the adjoining neighbour at no.20 Connaught Avenue through an unacceptable loss of light and outlook and an undue sense of enclosure. Additionally, as a result of its excessive depth, scale and bulk, the extension would also be out of proportion with the host property and would cause harm to the character of the surrounding area. It is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2 and SC7."
